<x-layouts.site title="Safety and community guidance">
    <div class="container page-shell">
        <div class="page-intro"><div><p class="section-label">Help centre</p><h1>Safety and community guidance</h1><p>Protect yourself and help keep Manitoba's local community network useful and respectful.</p></div><a class="button button-outline" href="/contact">Contact the team</a></div>
        <p class="notice">CanadaMB is not an emergency service. If someone is in immediate danger, call 911.</p>
        <div class="help-topic-grid">
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="marketplace" size="21"/> Buying and selling</h2><ul class="help-guidelines"><li>Inspect items before paying and meet in a safe, public place when practical.</li><li>Avoid unexpected requests for deposits, verification codes, gift cards or banking details.</li><li>Report misleading listings or suspected scams using the report option on the listing.</li></ul>@auth<a class="text-link" href="/account/listing-reports">Check your listing reports</a>@endauth</section>
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="messages" size="21"/> Messages and harassment</h2><ul class="help-guidelines"><li>Do not share passwords, verification codes, private addresses or financial information unnecessarily.</li><li>Use the Options menu in a conversation to block unwanted private messages.</li><li>@if(\App\Support\ContentReports::enabled()) Report an individual received message using its report link. Only the selected message is shown to independent authorized reviewers. @else For other concerns, contact the team with the relevant page URL or conversation reference. @endif Do not publicly repost private messages.</li></ul>@auth<a class="text-link" href="/account/blocked-members">Manage blocked members</a>@endauth</section>
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="discussions" size="21"/> Community discussions and events</h2><ul class="help-guidelines"><li>Disagree respectfully. Avoid threats, harassment, impersonation and sharing another person's private details.</li><li>Post useful information relevant to the community, not repeated promotional spam.</li><li>Check event details with the organizer before travelling or paying.</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/contact?topic=community">Raise a community concern</a></section>
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="briefcase" size="21"/> Jobs and businesses</h2><ul class="help-guidelines"><li>Verify an employer or business independently before sending money or personal documents.</li><li>Do not pay an application fee to an unverified recruiter.</li><li>Directory profiles and moderation are not a guarantee of legitimacy or endorsement.</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/contact?topic=business">Raise a business or job concern</a></section>
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="news" size="21"/> News and public notices</h2><p>Check the original publisher, date and source for important or changing information. Contact the team with the article URL and supporting sources if you notice an error.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact?topic=news">Suggest a correction</a></section>
            <section class="panel form-stack"><h2><x-icon name="shield" size="21"/> Account protection</h2><p>Use a unique password. If you suspect unauthorized access, change your password and sign out of all devices through account settings.</p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy-overview">Understand account privacy</a>@auth<a class="text-link" href="/account/settings">Account settings</a>@endauth</section>
        </div>
        <section class="panel form-stack mt-4"><h2>Reporting limitations during prelaunch</h2><p>Marketplace reports have a dedicated review queue. @if(\App\Support\ContentReports::enabled()) You can also report discussions, replies, events, jobs, businesses, member profiles and received messages. @else Other content concerns can be raised through the configured contact address. @endif Contacting the team is not a guarantee of immediate review or removal.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/contact?topic=safety">Contact about a safety concern</a></section>
    </div>
</x-layouts.site>
